From 570beee8fb4bc26f8045d2e371c2a4718d9205e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Headwaters <agents@braid.drp.icu>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:45:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Rebuild Gauge on useGauge and pass it a Reading

Gauge is now presentation only: it spreads the hook's meter and toggle
props and picks colors. It takes the API's Reading object (reading=...)
instead of loose value/min/max/alertAt props, so RiverCard passes
river.stage and friends straight through. The gauge test builds a Reading
from its flat fixtures; its assertions are unchanged.
---
 src/components/Gauge.tsx     | 68 +++++++-----------------------------
 src/components/RiverCard.tsx |  6 ++--
 test/gauge.test.tsx          | 27 +++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 38 insertions(+), 63 deletions(-)

